   "expression": "reverse(group_rank(ts_backfill(divide(subtract(news_eod_close, news_ton_last), ts_backfill(vec_count(high_price_excursion_stddev), 120)), 60), industry))",
   "optimize_reason": "冠军回填 + 行业内秩 @STATISTICAL。机制: Q 批槽1 的中性化对照——group_rank 与 neutralization 是独立机制 (组内排序 vs 风格约束), 可叠加; 本槽是家族全部合规杠杆 (消 MATCHES_THEMES/CW) x TO 杠杆 (回填) x 风格杠杆 (STATISTICAL) 的合并测试, 若 Sh>=1.3/TO<=35%/无警告, 即为当前最优候选。",
   "seed_id": "GATE1W5_R_2",
   "question_type": "MOVECNT_BF60_IND_RANKED_STAT"
  },
